[Term]
id: ENVO:01000536
name: factory
def: "A factory (previously manufactory) or manufacturing plant is an industrial site, usually consisting of buildings and machinery, or more commonly a complex having several buildings, where workers manufacture goods or operate machines processing one product into another." [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Factory]
synonym: "manufactory" EXACT []
