[Term]
id: ENVO:01001098
name: tectonic plate boundary
def: "A geomorphological feature which is formed where two or more tectonic plates move towards, away from, or along one another, resulting in deformation of the lithosphere." [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plate_tectonics]
