is_a: ENVO:01001084 ! particulate matter formation process
relationship: BFO:0000050 ENVO:01001654 ! part of aerosol formation process
relationship: RO:0002233 ENVO:01000797 ! has input gaseous environmental material

[Term]
id: ENVO:01001367
