comment: 20 Hertz is the average limit of human hearing.
is_a: ENVO:01001027 ! acoustic radiation

[Term]
id: ENVO:01001581
name: sea surface layer
def: "A surface layer which is part of an ocean or sea." []
comment: At this level, the depth of this layer is ambiguous. Some methods (telemetry) measure only the first few centimeters of the sea or ocean surface. In situ methods often sample the first few meters. Subclasses can be created for such cases.\nSea surface layer is also used to refer to the surfaces of oceans.
is_a: ENVO:01000295 ! marine layer
is_a: ENVO:01001554 ! surface layer of a water body

