def: "The thickness of some snow." []
synonym: "snow thickness" EXACT []
xref: http://sweetontology.net/propSpaceThickness/SnowCover {comment="Please also see \"snow cover\" in ENVO which maps to an alternative snow cover in SWEET."}
is_a: PATO:0000915 ! thickness
