synonym: "engine lubricant" EXACT []
synonym: "engine oil" EXACT []
is_a: ENVO:00003074 ! manufactured product

[Term]
id: ENVO:03510006
name: diesel fuel
def: "A liquid fuel used in diesel engines, whose fuel ignition takes place, without any spark, as a result of compression of the inlet air mixture and then injection of fuel." [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diesel_fuel, https://www.eia.gov/energyexplained/diesel-fuel/]
