is_a: FOODON:00001257 ! milk or milk based food product
is_a: FOODON:00001878 ! frozen dairy dessert
relationship: FOODON:00001563 FOODON:03420113 ! has defining ingredient mammalian milk or milk component
relationship: RO:0002350 FOODON:03400227 ! member of ice cream (us cfr)

