comment: This is a convenience class inherited from LanguaL
xref: langual:H0263
is_a: FOODON:00001174 ! plant lipid food product
union_of: FOODON:00001087 ! vegetable oil food product
union_of: FOODON:03316694 ! vegetable fat food product

