[Term]
id: UBERON:0004876
name: urogenital fold
def: "One of of the pair of folds derived from the cloacal folds which give rise to a portion of the external genitalia; in male embryos they close over the urethral plate and fuse to form the spongy (penile) urethra and ventral aspect of the penis, not including the glans; failure of fusion of the urethral folds leads to hypospadias; in female embryos they fuse only anterior to the anus and form the labia minora[MP]." [MP:0011835, MP:anna, Wikipedia:Urogenital_folds]
synonym: "urethral fold" EXACT [EMAPA:30888]
synonym: "urogenital fold" EXACT [EHDAA2:0004022, MP:0011835]
